WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
A text arrives from a
friend who has moved abroad:

2
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:07.190
«Tu me manques.» You can
spot 'you' and 'me' in there.

3
00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:09.360
But who is missing whom?

4
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.870
Then try 'I have lived
here for five years'.

5
00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.760
French builds that
sentence very differently.

6
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.290
So what is really going on in that text,

7
00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:22.000
and how does French say how long
something has been happening?

8
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.670
In this mission, you'll
follow a flowchart that picks

9
00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:27.660
the right little word
for any place on the map.

10
00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.160
Then you'll place events
on a timeline and choose

11
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.260
the tense for each sentence.

12
00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:38.110
Your mission: crack «manquer», «depuis»
and the little words before every place.
